Todos represent single units of work—or tasks—within [[Projects|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Projects]] or the [[Inbox|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Inbox]]. Any tiddler with the <<tag todo>> tag is recognized as a todo.

!! Task Lifecycle & Statuses

Beyond simple open/done checkboxes, each task can have a `status` field (chosen from the task's {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/dots}} menu or its tiddler header):

* {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/checkbox}} ''To Do'' (`todo`) — Open and actionable.
* {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/status-in-progress}} ''In Progress'' (`in-progress`) — Actively being worked on.
* {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/status-waiting}} ''Waiting'' (`waiting`) — Waiting on an external person or event (hidden from *Next Actions*, surfaced in *Review*).
* {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/status-someday}} ''Someday / Maybe'' (`someday`) — Deferred for future consideration.
* {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/checkbox-checked-solid}} ''Done'' (`done`) — Completed (automatically records a `completed` timestamp for the **Completed Logbook**).
* {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/status-cancelled}} ''Cancelled'' (`cancelled`) — Dropped or no longer needed.

!! Priorities & `@Contexts`

* ''Priority'': Assign High (`3`), Medium (`2`), or Low (`1`) priority using the {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/flag}} button or inline tokens (`!1`–`!3`).
* ''`@Contexts`'': Tag tasks with one or more GTD contexts (such as `@work`, `@home`, `@computer`, `@errands`, `@calls`) from the {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/dots}} menu or inline (`@work`). Filter by context in the **Next** and **Filter** dashboard tabs.

!! Inline Sub-Tasks & Renaming

* ''Sub-tasks'': Choose **Add sub-tasks** from a task's {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/dots}} menu to turn it into a `SubProject` and expand its sub-tasks directly inline—complete with an inline quick-add input and recursive progress pie chart.
* ''Rename inline'': Choose **Rename task** in the {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/dots}} menu to edit the task's display caption inline without opening the tiddler.
* ''Dependencies'': Inside a task tiddler's **More** menu, set **Blocked by** (`blocked-by`) to another open task. Blocked tasks display a {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/lock}} badge and wait until their blocker is completed.

<<py-tip "To customize how todos are displayed, you can override the shadow tiddler [[$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/todo/TodoCaption]].">>
